user default off
user relay on #<RELAY_SHA256> ~nf:* -@all +ping +exists +xadd +xrange +xinfo|groups +xpending
user worker on #<WORKER_SHA256> ~nf:* -@all +ping +exists +xinfo|groups +xgroup|create +xreadgroup +xautoclaim +xack
user maintenance on #<MAINTENANCE_SHA256> ~nf:* -@all +ping +exists +xrange +xdel +xinfo|groups +xpending
